# The Gobbiebag Part IX (jeuno 123): reqsMet's operands one at a time, in both checks. Parts I-VIII completed (the
# chain's earlier parts, by a GM), Jeuno fame level 5. The inventory at 30 (a fresh char): no section (43 (81)); at 70
# (storage, a GM's player:changeContainerSize): fame level 4 (649 / 2 = 324): no section; Part VIII set accepted (a GM):
# no section; all met: 43 (71, 0, 1), begun. Accepted: fame level 4: no section; Part VIII accepted: no section (Part
# VIII itself: its size 65 unmet); all met: 43 (71, 1, 1). A GM sets a part available before accepted (accepted over
# completed keeps it completed).
lists LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/43
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-41.7,5.9,-113 job=WAR lvl=75
fame Sandoria 650
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIi completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIii completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIv completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartV completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVi completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVii completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartViii completed
login
trigger Bluffnix                        # the inventory 30, not 70: no section; 43 (81)
finish
storage inventory 70                    # a GM's player:changeContainerSize to the part's start size
fame Sandoria 649                       # a GM: fame level 4
trigger Bluffnix                        # below the fame level: no section; 43 (81)
finish
fame Sandoria 650                       # a GM
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartViii available # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartViii accepted # a GM: Part VIII not completed
trigger Bluffnix                        # no section (Part VIII: inventory 70 is not its 65); 43 (81)
finish
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartViii completed # a GM
trigger Bluffnix                        # all met: 43 (71, 0, 1)
finish option=0                         # begun
fame Sandoria 649                       # a GM: fame level 4
trigger Bluffnix                        # accepted, below the fame level: no section; 43 (81)
finish
fame Sandoria 650                       # a GM
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartViii available # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartViii accepted # a GM
trigger Bluffnix                        # accepted, the previous part not completed: no section; 43 (81)
finish
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartViii completed # a GM
trigger Bluffnix                        # all met: 43 (71, 1, 1)
finish
